!Sample_data_processing = Base calling and demultiplexing was performed using Illumina bcl2fastq software.
!Sample_data_processing = 20bp sgRNA sequence was extracted from each read.
!Sample_data_processing = Each 20bp sequence was aligned to the human TKOv3 CRISPR library with Bowtie.
!Sample_data_processing = Count table was generated through counting the frequency of each sgRNA.
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tab-delimited counts file
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR Screen
